1
00:00:00,559 --> 00:00:01,759
This is Beach Craft

2
00:00:01,759 --> 00:00:04,599
for Minecraft twenty six point three.

3
00:00:04,599 --> 00:00:06,939
In this review I show you every feature

4
00:00:06,939 --> 00:00:07,379
of the mod,

5
00:00:07,379 --> 00:00:09,060
so you can see what it does,

6
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,729
and that it works.

7
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:14,310
Dark driftwood stumps stand

8
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:15,910
on sandy beaches,

9
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:18,070
and a driftwood sapling grows a new one

10
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:19,420
with bone meal.

11
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:21,400
Their logs build the portal.

12
00:00:22,782 --> 00:00:25,102
Shipwreck treasure, buried treasure

13
00:00:25,102 --> 00:00:27,722
and ocean ruins hide ancient broken rings,

14
00:00:27,722 --> 00:00:30,952
and shipwrecks also hold ancient crystals.

15
00:00:32,387 --> 00:00:35,427
A furnace or a blast furnace melts each ring

16
00:00:35,427 --> 00:00:36,977
into ancient energy.

17
00:00:38,381 --> 00:00:40,841
Four driftwood logs around one ancient

18
00:00:40,841 --> 00:00:43,491
energy make four portal frames.

19
00:00:43,801 --> 00:00:44,621
Energy,

20
00:00:44,621 --> 00:00:47,291
crystal and a stick make the energy staff.

21
00:00:48,471 --> 00:00:49,911
The staff tells you when

22
00:00:49,911 --> 00:00:51,011
you click the wrong block,

23
00:00:51,011 --> 00:00:53,621
or when the frame is not finished.

24
00:00:53,891 --> 00:00:55,671
Once the frame is complete,

25
00:00:55,671 --> 00:00:57,201
one click lights the portal.

26
00:00:59,043 --> 00:01:01,803
Step inside, and you arrive on a small

27
00:01:01,803 --> 00:01:03,523
driftwood platform high above

28
00:01:03,523 --> 00:01:06,513
the endless sea, with a portal back home.

29
00:01:08,116 --> 00:01:10,766
The raft teleporter skips the portal.

30
00:01:10,956 --> 00:01:12,336
It drops you on a stone block,

31
00:01:12,336 --> 00:01:14,086
right on the water.

32
00:01:16,069 --> 00:01:18,209
The raft ocean has sandy islands

33
00:01:18,209 --> 00:01:19,779
with palm trees.

34
00:01:20,049 --> 00:01:22,409
A palm sapling grows with bone meal,

35
00:01:22,409 --> 00:01:23,529
and you can pick

36
00:01:23,529 --> 00:01:25,479
coconuts right off the leaves.

37
00:01:27,178 --> 00:01:29,258
The current carries debris past you

38
00:01:29,258 --> 00:01:30,638
from the west: plastic,

39
00:01:30,638 --> 00:01:33,238
scrap metal, planks, palm leaves,

40
00:01:33,238 --> 00:01:35,808
and now and then some lost loot.

41
00:01:37,204 --> 00:01:39,344
Hold right click with the plastic hook,

42
00:01:39,344 --> 00:01:41,364
and the floating items fly straight

43
00:01:41,364 --> 00:01:42,354
to you.

44
00:01:43,845 --> 00:01:44,945
An item catcher

45
00:01:44,945 --> 00:01:47,695
in the water collects debris on its own.

46
00:01:47,925 --> 00:01:49,135
With a net inside,

47
00:01:49,305 --> 00:01:52,085
it also fishes unrefined ocean garbage out

48
00:01:52,085 --> 00:01:52,935
of the sea.

49
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:56,969
Smelt the garbage into a trash cube.

50
00:01:57,279 --> 00:01:59,099
Every cube you open pops out one

51
00:01:59,099 --> 00:02:00,829
to three random items.

52
00:02:03,337 --> 00:02:05,487
Two palm leaves make rope.

53
00:02:05,837 --> 00:02:07,497
Four rope make a rope coil,

54
00:02:07,497 --> 00:02:09,927
and rope on white wool makes sail canvas.

55
00:02:11,432 --> 00:02:12,712
Rope ladders can be

56
00:02:12,712 --> 00:02:14,722
climbed like normal ladders.

57
00:02:16,303 --> 00:02:19,163
The water purifier burns coal or wood,

58
00:02:19,163 --> 00:02:20,983
and turns a water bucket

59
00:02:20,983 --> 00:02:23,433
into three bottles of fresh water.

60
00:02:25,041 --> 00:02:27,041
Fresh water fills you up a little,

61
00:02:27,041 --> 00:02:28,881
coconut milk heals you,

62
00:02:28,881 --> 00:02:30,661
and a pina colada makes you fast

63
00:02:30,661 --> 00:02:32,471
for two and a half minutes.

64
00:02:32,741 --> 00:02:34,371
You even get the bowl back.

65
00:02:35,905 --> 00:02:38,905
The simple grill cooks two foods at once,

66
00:02:38,905 --> 00:02:40,575
faster than a campfire.

67
00:02:42,321 --> 00:02:44,961
Crops on a crop plot grow about half again

68
00:02:44,961 --> 00:02:47,091
as fast as on wet farmland.

69
00:02:47,541 --> 00:02:49,261
The plot never dries out,

70
00:02:49,261 --> 00:02:50,931
and you cannot trample it.

71
00:02:52,404 --> 00:02:54,524
A scarecrow keeps hostile mobs

72
00:02:54,524 --> 00:02:56,624
from spawning within twenty four blocks,

73
00:02:56,624 --> 00:02:59,764
and protects farmland within eight.

74
00:02:59,764 --> 00:03:02,114
Its head now always faces you.

75
00:03:03,820 --> 00:03:06,610
Bruce the shark lives in the raft ocean.

76
00:03:08,047 --> 00:03:10,187
As long as you stay on your raft,

77
00:03:10,187 --> 00:03:11,377
he leaves you alone.

78
00:03:11,767 --> 00:03:13,777
Jump into the water, and he attacks.

79
00:03:15,598 --> 00:03:18,528
Beat him for shark meat and shark teeth.

80
00:03:18,958 --> 00:03:20,318
Three teeth and three planks make

81
00:03:20,318 --> 00:03:22,508
a shark jaw trophy for your wall.

82
00:03:24,308 --> 00:03:26,088
The receiver shows the direction

83
00:03:26,088 --> 00:03:26,748
and distance

84
00:03:26,748 --> 00:03:29,458
to the nearest floating driftwood.

85
00:03:30,967 --> 00:03:32,787
In a boat, the paddle gives you

86
00:03:32,787 --> 00:03:34,417
a strong push forward.

87
00:03:36,274 --> 00:03:38,174
Titanium ore hides deep

88
00:03:38,174 --> 00:03:39,194
under the sea floor,

89
00:03:39,194 --> 00:03:41,814
and needs a diamond pickaxe.

90
00:03:41,814 --> 00:03:44,664
Smelt the raw titanium into ingots.

91
00:03:45,844 --> 00:03:48,004
A full set of titanium armor gives

92
00:03:48,004 --> 00:03:49,294
you water breathing,

93
00:03:49,824 --> 00:03:52,214
dolphin's grace and conduit power.

94
00:03:53,730 --> 00:03:55,830
The metal detector tells you how deep

95
00:03:55,830 --> 00:03:58,400
the next titanium ore below you is.

96
00:03:59,792 --> 00:04:01,452
And three music discs hide

97
00:04:01,452 --> 00:04:02,882
in shipwreck treasure.

98
00:04:05,574 --> 00:04:07,494
Makeshift solar panels charge

99
00:04:07,494 --> 00:04:09,234
the makeshift battery,

100
00:04:09,234 --> 00:04:11,644
and cables carry the energy to machines,

101
00:04:11,854 --> 00:04:13,444
even to Tech Reborn.

102
00:04:15,010 --> 00:04:16,350
The quarry digs out

103
00:04:16,350 --> 00:04:17,670
an eleven by eleven area,

104
00:04:17,670 --> 00:04:21,160
block by block, into the chest on top.

105
00:04:22,738 --> 00:04:24,018
The brick furnace smelts

106
00:04:24,018 --> 00:04:26,218
faster than a normal one,

107
00:04:26,218 --> 00:04:28,698
and the titanium furnace is extremely fast

108
00:04:28,698 --> 00:04:31,288
and even doubles every result.

109
00:04:33,044 --> 00:04:34,404
For building there are palm

110
00:04:34,404 --> 00:04:35,924
and driftwood wood,

111
00:04:35,924 --> 00:04:38,244
palm thatch, sail canvas,

112
00:04:38,244 --> 00:04:40,224
scrap metal and plastic blocks,

113
00:04:40,224 --> 00:04:43,694
a ship wheel, a flag and coconut lanterns.

114
00:04:45,255 --> 00:04:46,975
While making this review,

115
00:04:46,975 --> 00:04:49,775
I found and fixed more than twenty bugs: sharks

116
00:04:49,775 --> 00:04:50,675
that never spawned,

117
00:04:50,675 --> 00:04:52,955
the sail canvas recipe,

118
00:04:52,955 --> 00:04:55,435
the scarecrow's head, the item catcher,

119
00:04:55,435 --> 00:04:57,525
wood that did not burn, and more.

120
00:04:57,955 --> 00:05:00,185
The full list is in the changelog.

121
00:05:01,454 --> 00:05:04,284
That's Beach Craft. Free on CurseForge!

